+msgstr "低音管理"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Bass management needs a subwoofer channel, and the profile of this device has none."
+msgstr "低音管理需要重低音喇叭聲道，而此裝置的設定檔沒有。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Large (full range)"
+msgstr "大（全頻）"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Small (bass goes to the subwoofer)"
+msgstr "小（低音送往重低音喇叭）"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Crossover:"
+msgstr "分頻點："
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Small speakers play only what is above the crossover; what is below goes to the subwoofer, with a 24 dB per octave slope. With every speaker large nothing is added to the signal."
+msgstr "小喇叭只播放分頻點以上的內容；分頻點以下的內容送往重低音喇叭，斜率為每倍頻程 24 dB。所有喇叭都為大時，不會對訊號加入任何內容。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Output"
+msgstr "輸出"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Make the speaker setup the output of this account"
+msgstr "將喇叭設定設為此帳號的輸出"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Programs reach the speakers through the setup only while it is the output they play to. With every speaker at its defaults there is no setup and nothing is added to the signal."
+msgstr "只有在喇叭設定是程式播放的輸出時，程式才會經過它到達喇叭。所有喇叭都為預設值時沒有設定，也不會對訊號加入任何內容。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
