+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "The device of this speaker setup is not connected. The setup waits for it and plays nowhere else."
+msgstr "此喇叭設定的裝置未連線。設定會等待它，不會在其他地方播放。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "For every account applies to distances and bass management only. Levels are the device's channel volumes, which each account keeps."
+msgstr "套用於所有帳號只涉及距離和低音管理。位準是裝置的聲道音量，每個帳號各自保留。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Levels are the device's channel volumes, the same values as Show Channels, and change at once. They go from -30 dB to 0 dB, or up to +10.6 dB when Raise maximum volume is on in Configure Volume Controls."
+msgstr "位準是裝置的聲道音量，與「顯示聲道」中的值相同，會立即生效。範圍為 -30 dB 到 0 dB，在「設定音量控制」中開啟提高最大音量時可到 +10.6 dB。"
+
+#. Speaker Setup: levels, distances, bass management and the test signal.
+msgid "Applying this restarts the sound system: sound stops for a moment in every program."
+msgstr "套用此項會重新啟動音效系統：所有程式的聲音會短暫停止。"
